<title>UK: Guinness sets $250 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Guinness sets $250 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GUINNESS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    17.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.924   PAY DATE    17.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.749    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STNDARD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURIES -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
